.TH DJOBLOG 8
.SH NAME
djoblog \- Diablo program to run a job and log its output with a time stamp on every line
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B djoblog [-C diablo.config] [-s] [-f file] [-V] job command [arg ...]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.IR DJobLog
runs
.I command
with its standard output and standard error read through a pipe, and
writes every line of it to a log, in the format of the other diablo logs:
.PP
.nf
2026-10-31 02:40:01.123 daily.atrim[4711]: line
.fi
.PP
The log is
.IR path_log /\fIjob\fR.log
(see diablo.config), for example /news/log/hourly.expire.log.  The start
and the end of the job are logged too: a
.B BEGIN
line with the command, and an
.B END
line with the exit status of the command, or the signal that killed it.
Control characters other than TAB in the output are replaced by '?'; a line
longer than 4096 characters is split.
.PP
The exit status of
.I djoblog
is the exit status of the command (128 plus the signal number when it was
killed, 127 when it could not be executed), so cron and the caller see
the status of the job.  Usage errors exit with 2.  A log that cannot be written is
reported once on standard error; the job still runs.
.PP
The log file is opened for each batch of lines and closed again, so it can be
rotated while the job runs, even by the job itself (adm/daily.atrim rotates
the job logs, including its own).
.PP
.I job
is a name of letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-' that does not start with '.'
or '-'.
.PP
.B \-C diablo.config
.PP
Read this diablo.config.  It is read before the command is started, and
only options before the job name are the program's own: options of the command
come after the command name.
.PP
.B \-f file
.PP
Write the log to this file instead of path_log/job.log.
.PP
.B \-s
.PP
Log to syslog instead of a file: facility news, the job name as the tag, with the
process id.  Lines are logged at level notice; the END line of a job that failed
at level err.  Where the lines end up depends on the syslog configuration.
.PP
.B \-V
.PP
Print the version and exit.

.SH EXAMPLES
In the crontab of the news user:
.PP
.nf
50 * * * *  /news/dbin/djoblog hourly.expire /news/adm/hourly.expire
40 2 * * *  /news/dbin/djoblog daily.atrim /news/adm/daily.atrim
.fi

